        "text": "Fig. 1 shows four animals kept in a village in Ghana, lettered **A**, **B**, **C** and **D**. The four animals are a cow, a fowl, a goat and a pig, but they are **not** shown in that order.\n\n\n\n*Fig. 1: Four animals kept in a village in Ghana.*\n\n**(a)** Name the animal shown at **A**, **B**, **C** and **D**.  **[4 marks]**\n\n**(b)** State the group - ruminant, monogastric animal or poultry - to which **A**, **C** and **D** belong.  **[3 marks]**\n\n**(c)** (i) State ONE feature seen in Fig. 1 that shows that **B** is not the same kind of animal as **D**.  **[1 mark]**\n\n(ii) State TWO similarities between **A** and **B**.  **[2 marks]**\n\n---"
