        "number": 1,
        "marks": 10,
        "text": "Fig. 1 shows the human digestive system. The parts are lettered **A** to **F**.\n\n\n\n*Fig. 1: The human digestive system.*\n\n**(a)** Name the parts labelled **A**, **B**, **C**, **D**, **E** and **F**.  **[6 marks]**\n\n**(b)** State ONE function of **D** and ONE function of **E**.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(c)** A pupil swallowed a piece of boiled yam. Using the letters in Fig. 1, give the order of the parts through which the yam passes from the moment it enters the body until the waste leaves it.  **[2 marks]**\n\n---"
