        "text": "Fig. 1 shows the four stages in the life cycle of the housefly. The stages are lettered **A**, **B**, **C** and **D**, and the arrows show the order in which they follow one another.\n\n\n\n*Fig. 1: The life cycle of the housefly.*\n\n**(a)** Name the stages labelled **A**, **B**, **C** and **D**.  **[4 marks]**\n\n**(b)** Using the letters only, write the four stages in the order in which they occur, beginning with the stage that comes first.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(c)** State what happens at stage **A** and at stage **D**.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(d)** Explain why the changes shown in Fig. 1 are described as a **cycle**.\n\n---"
