        "number": 3,
        "marks": 10,
        "text": "A Basic 7 class at Ejisu was asked to write short notes on the stages of the life cycle of the housefly and to explain why the housefly increases so quickly during the rainy season.\n\n**(a)** Copy and complete the table below in your answer booklet.  **[4 marks]**\n\n| Stage | Where it is usually found |\n|---|---|\n| Egg | ......... |\n| Larva | ......... |\n| Pupa | ......... |\n| Adult | ......... |\n\n**(b)** Explain why the number of houseflies in a town rises quickly during the rainy season.  **[3 marks]**\n\n**(c)** The class agreed that the surest way to control the housefly is to attack it at the egg and larva stages rather than to kill adult flies. Give THREE reasons for this.  **[3 marks]**\n\n---"
