        "text": "Fig. 2 shows, in four stages lettered **P**, **Q**, **R** and **S**, how one famous scientific discovery reached the patient.\n\n\n\n*Fig. 2: From a laboratory dish to a cured patient.*\n\n**(a)** In stage **P**, a mould is growing on the dish and no germs are growing near it.\n\n(i) Name the scientist who made this observation.  **[1 mark]**\n\n(ii) Name the medicine that came from it.  **[1 mark]**\n\n(iii) State what the clear space around the mould showed.  **[1 mark]**\n\n**(b)** Describe briefly what is happening at stages **Q**, **R** and **S**.  **[3 marks]**\n\n**(c)** Use Fig. 2 to explain the link between science and industry.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(d)** Fleming noticed something that others might have thrown away. State TWO qualities of a good scientist that this shows.  **[2 marks]**\n\n---"
